    "warranty": "Commercial Grade SABS Food Safe",
    "specs": "A three-part Sunnex cereal dispenser with three 4-litre hoppers, built for high-volume breakfast and buffet service in h",
    "image": "https://mitrend.co.za/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Sunnex-3-x-4lt-dispenser-revolving.jpg",
